## Getting Started

### Prerequisites

- Node.js 20+
- pnpm 9+
- {% if tech_stack.database == 'postgresql' %}PostgreSQL 15+{% elif tech_stack.database == 'sqlite' %}SQLite 3{% else %}Database TBD{% endif %}

### Installation

```bash
# Clone the repository
git clone <repository-url>
cd {{ project_name_kebab }}

# Install dependencies
pnpm install

# Set up environment variables
cp .env.example .env
# Edit .env with your configuration

# Initialize database
pnpm db:push

# Start development server
pnpm dev
```

### Environment Variables

See `.env.example` for all required variables.

